Package: gapwise
Title: Find and Handle Gaps in Repeated Measures Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Jim", "Wang", email = "maojia.wang@mail.utoronto.ca", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools for data in which the same units (patients, hospitals,
    countries) are measured at several time points. The functions report
    whether every unit has a row at every time point, add the rows that are
    absent, summarise missing values and attrition over time, and create
    lagged variables that are matched on the value of the time variable
    rather than on row position, so that a gap in the data cannot shift the
    lag onto the wrong time point.
